    <comment>- PAmix -&gt; pamix (lowercase per factory rules)
- update to 1.6:
  * improved stability
  * Can reconnect to pulseaudio
  * --version argument
  * Fixed issues with Cards tab
  * Updated Default Configuration
- build switched to cmake
- initial package with 1.5 release
</comment>
