  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>326657073f7312668e42ec1e1d8a9c37</srcmd5>
    <version>2.1</version>
    <time>1792344180</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 2.1:
  * Complete rewrite in C (was C++); build now only needs a C
    compiler
  * Tab cycling between views; arrow keys in the default config;
    25 ms escape delay so cursor keys no longer freeze the UI
  * Handle terminal resize, fix background drawing and reject
    bindings of unknown commands with an error
  * Fix volume under/overflow in add-volume and a crash on empty
    port lists; check the port index before printing
- Add pamix-install-man-to-man1.patch to install the man page
  into the man1 subdir
- Drop gcc-c++ BuildRequires: No longer needed nor used.
</comment>
    <requestid>1385672</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
